OpenHub was taken from OpenLogi at commit b32ae087 on 2026-08-27. The complete
OpenLogi git history is preserved in this repository, so every inherited commit
keeps its original author. The two projects have different goals: OpenLogi
targets Logitech Options+ and productivity peripherals; OpenHub targets
Logitech G HUB and gaming peripherals — per-game profiles, macros with repeat
modes, and the HID++ features gaming mice expose (0x8100 onboard profiles,
0x8110 button spy).

OpenHub is an independent project. It is not endorsed by, affiliated with, or
supported by the OpenLogi project or its authors. Please do not report OpenHub
issues to the OpenLogi tracker.

